></ul></div></div></div></div><div></div><div class=\"GfgPostLayout_quizComponentContainer__Zla_Q\"><div class=\"GfgPostLayout_quizComponentContainer_content__WzdAa\"><div id=\"LeftBarOutsideIndia_sidebar_OI__n_7R4\" class=\"sidebar_wrapper\"><div style=\"margin-bottom:10px\" id=\"GFG_AD_Leftsidebar_300x250_chained_1\"></div><div style=\"margin-bottom:10px\" id=\"GFG_AD_Leftsidebar_300x250_chained_2\"></div><div style=\"margin-bottom:10px\" id=\"GFG_AD_Leftsidebar_300x250_chained_3\"></div><div style=\"margin-bottom:10px\" id=\"GFG_AD_Leftsidebar_300x600_chained_1\"></div></div><div class=\"QuizQuestionCardsCollection_article--viewer__iYKAo article--viewer\"><div class=\"QuizQuestionCardsCollection_mainContentContainer__Uu0fa\"><div class=\"QuizQuestionCardsCollection_mainContentContainer_innerContentContainer__qyLK3\"><div class=\"QuizHeader_quizHeaderContainer__UXkgY\"><header class=\"QuizHeader_quizHeaderContainer__quizHeader__N_1lx\"><h1 class=\"QuizHeader_quizHeaderContainer__quizHeader__titleHeading__lhMiT\">Functions in C</h1></header><div class=\"QuizHeader_quizHeaderContainer__updationStatusComment__rERyi\"><div><div class=\"QuizUpdationStatus_lastUpdationDateConainer__bmecR\" style=\"font-size:15px\">Last Updated : </div></div><div class=\"QuizHeader_quizHeaderContainer__updationStatusComment__commentOuterDiv__SrSrZ\">Discuss<div class=\"QuizHeader_quizHeaderContainer__updationStatusComment__commentOuterDiv__comment__X8RTI\"><span class=\"QuizHeader_quizHeaderContainer__updationStatusComment__commentOuterDiv__comment__commentTooltiptext__E_zol\" style=\"opacity:0\">Comments</span></div></div></div></div><div class=\"QuizQuestionCard_quizCard__9T_0J\"><div class=\"QuizQuestionCard_quizCard__header__8owjs\"><p class=\"QuizQuestionCard_quizCard__header__questionNumber__GffEN\">Question <!-- -->1</p></div><div class=\"QuizQuestionCard_quizCard__quizQuestionTextContainer__CzNWr QuizQuestionCard_quizCard_notGfgTabs__q5ycp\"><div class=\"QuizQuestionCard_quizCard__quizQuestionTextContainer__question__tv5de\"><p dir=\"ltr\"><span>What is a function in C?</span></p><p><br></p></div></div><ul class=\"QuizQuestionCard_quizCard__optionsList__4pILJ\"><li class=\"QuizQuestionCard_quizCard__optionsList__optionItem__6OtkL false \"><div class=\"QuizQuestionCard_quizCard__optionsList__optionItem__optionInputSecond__Ye4j9 \n                                false\n                            \"></div><div class=\"QuizQuestionCard_quizCard__optionsList__optionItem__optionLabel__ZJEuI\"><div><p dir=\"ltr\"><span>A keyword</span></p></div></div></li><li class=\"QuizQuestionCard_quizCard__optionsList__optionItem__6OtkL false \"><div class=\"QuizQuestionCard_quizCard__optionsList__optionItem__optionInputSecond__Ye4j9 \n                                false\n                            \"></div><div class=\"QuizQuestionCard_quizCard__optionsList__optionItem__optionLabel__ZJEuI\"><div><p dir=\"ltr\"><span>A type of variable</span></p></div></div></li><li class=\"QuizQuestionCard_quizCard__optionsList__optionItem__6OtkL false \"><div class=\"QuizQuestionCard_quizCard__optionsList__optionItem__optionInputSecond__Ye4j9 \n                                false\n                            \"></div><div class=\"QuizQuestionCard_quizCard__optionsList__optionItem__optionLabel__ZJEuI\"><div><p dir=\"ltr\"><span>A block of code that performs a specific task. </span></p></div></div></li><li class=\"QuizQuestionCard_quizCard__optionsList__optionItem__6OtkL false \"><div class=\"QuizQuestionCard_quizCard__optionsList__optionItem__optionInputSecond__Ye4j9 \n                                false\n                            \"></div><div class=\"QuizQuestionCard_quizCard__optionsList__optionItem__optionLabel__ZJEuI\"><div><p dir=\"ltr\"><span>A preproccessor directive</span></p></div></div></li></ul></div><div class=\"QuizQuestionCard_quizCard__9T_0J\"><div class=\"QuizQuestionCard_quizCard__header__8owjs\"><p class=\"QuizQuestionCard_quizCard__header__questionNumber__GffEN\">Question <!-- -->2</p></div><div class=\"QuizQuestionCard_quizCard__quizQuestionTextContainer__CzNWr QuizQuestionCard_quizCard_notGfgTabs__q5ycp\"><div class=\"QuizQuestionCard_quizCard__quizQuestionTextContainer__question__tv5de\"><p dir=\"ltr\"><span>Which of the following is the correct way to declare a function in C?</span></p><p><br></p></div></div><ul class=\"QuizQuestionCard_quizCard__optionsList__4pILJ\"><li class=\"QuizQuestionCard_quizCard__optionsList__optionItem__6OtkL false \"><div class=\"QuizQuestionCard_quizCard__optionsList__optionItem__optionInputSecond__Ye4j9 \n                                false\n                            \"></div><div class=\"QuizQuestionCard_quizCard__optionsList__optionItem__optionLabel__ZJEuI\"><div><p dir=\"ltr\"><span>func int ();</span></p></div></div></li><li class=\"QuizQuestionCard_quizCard__optionsList__optionItem__6OtkL false \"><div class=\"QuizQuestionCard_quizCard__optionsList__optionItem__optionInputSecond__Ye4j9 \n                                false\n                            \"></div><div class=\"QuizQuestionCard_quizCard__optionsList__optionItem__optionLabel__ZJEuI\"><div><p dir=\"ltr\"><span>int function();</span></p></div></div></li><li class=\"QuizQuestionCard_quizCard__optionsList__optionItem__6OtkL false \"><div class=\"QuizQuestionCard_quizCard__optionsList__optionItem__optionInputSecond__Ye4j9 \n                                false\n                            \"></div><div class=\"QuizQuestionCard_quizCard__optionsList__optionItem__optionLabel__ZJEuI\"><div><p dir=\"ltr\"><span>int = function();</span></p></div></div></li><li class=\"QuizQuestionCard_quizCard__optionsList__optionItem__6OtkL false \"><div class=\"QuizQuestionCard_quizCard__optionsList__optionItem__optionInputSecond__Ye4j9 \n                                false\n                            \"></div><div class=\"QuizQuestionCard_quizCard__optionsList__optionItem__optionLabel__ZJEuI\"><div><p dir=\"ltr\"><span>function int ();</span></p></div></div></li></ul></div><div class=\"QuizQuestionCard_quizCard__9T_0J\"><div class=\"QuizQuestionCard_quizCard__header__8owjs\"><p class=\"QuizQuestionCard_quizCard__header__questionNumber__GffEN\">Question <!-- -->3</p></div><div class=\"QuizQuestionCard_quizCard__quizQuestionTextContainer__CzNWr QuizQuestionCard_quizCard_notGfgTabs__q5ycp\"><div class=\"QuizQuestionCard_quizCard__quizQuestionTextContainer__question__tv5de\"><p dir=\"ltr\"><span>In C, what is the meaning of following </span><b><strong>function prototype</strong></b><span> with empty parameter list.</span></p><gfg-tabs data-run-ide=\"false\">\n        <gfg-tab slot=\"tab\">C</gfg-tab>\n        <gfg-panel slot=\"panel\" data-code-lang=\"c\">\n        <code class=\"language-c\"><div class=\"highlight\"><pre><span></span><span class=\"kt\">void</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nf\">fun</span><span class=\"p\">();</span>\n</pre></div></code>\n        </gfg-panel>\n    </gfg-tabs></div></div><ul class=\"QuizQuestionCard_quizCard__optionsList__4pILJ\"><li class=\"QuizQuestionCard_quizCard__optionsList__optionItem__6OtkL false \"><div class=\"QuizQuestionCard_quizCard__optionsList__optionItem__optionInputSecond__Ye4j9 \n                                false\n                            \"></div><div class=\"QuizQuestionCard_quizCard__optionsList__optionItem__optionLabel__ZJEuI\"><div><p dir=\"ltr\"><span>Function can only be defined without any parameter.</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><br></p></div></div></li><li class=\"QuizQuestionCard_quizCard__optionsList__optionItem__6OtkL false \"><div class=\"QuizQuestionCard_quizCard__optionsList__optionItem__optionInputSecond__Ye4j9 \n                                false\n                            \"></div><div class=\"QuizQuestionCard_quizCard__optionsList__optionItem__optionLabel__ZJEuI\"><div><p dir=\"ltr\"><span>Function can be defined with any number of parameters of any types.</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><br></p></div></div></li><li class=\"QuizQuestionCard_quizCard__optionsList__optionItem__6OtkL false \"><div class=\"QuizQuestionCard_quizCard__optionsList__optionItem__optionInputSecond__Ye4j9 \n                                false\n                            \"></div><div class=\"QuizQuestionCard_quizCard__optionsList__optionItem__optionLabel__ZJEuI\"><div><p dir=\"ltr\"><span>Function can be defined with any number of integer parameters.</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><br></p></div></div></li><li class=\"QuizQuestionCard_quizCard__optionsList__optionItem__6OtkL false \"><div class=\"QuizQuestionCard_quizCard__optionsList__optionItem__optionInputSecond__Ye4j9 \n                                false\n                            \"></div><div class=\"QuizQuestionCard_quizCard__optionsList__optionItem__optionLabel__ZJEuI\"><div><p dir=\"ltr\"><span>Function can be defined with one integer parameter.</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><br></p></div></div></li></ul></div><div class=\"QuizQuestionCard_quizCard__9T_0J\"><div class=\"QuizQuestionCard_quizCard__header__8owjs\"><p class=\"QuizQuestionCard_quizCard__header__questionNumber__GffEN\">Question <!-- -->4</p></div><div class=\"QuizQuestionCard_quizCard__quizQuestionTextContainer__CzNWr QuizQuestionCard_quizCard_notGfgTabs__q5ycp\"><div class=\"QuizQuestionCard_quizCard__quizQuestionTextContainer__question__tv5de\"><p dir=\"ltr\"><span> What keyword is used to return a value from a function?</span></p><p><br></p></div></div><ul class=\"QuizQuestionCard_quizCard__optionsList__4pILJ\"><li class=\"QuizQuestionCard_quizCard__optionsList__optionItem__6OtkL false \"><div class=\"QuizQuestionCard_quizCard__optionsList__optionItem__optionInputSecond__Ye4j9 \n                                false\n                            \"></div><div class=\"QuizQuestionCard_quizCard__optionsList__optionItem__optionLabel__ZJEuI\"><div><p dir=\"ltr\"><span>break</span></p></div></div></li><li class=\"QuizQuestionCard_quizCard__optionsList__optionItem__6OtkL false \"><div class=\"QuizQuestionCard_quizCard__optionsList__optionItem__optionInputSecond__Ye4j9 \n                                false\n                            \"></div><div class=\"QuizQuestionCard_quizCard__optionsList__optionItem__optionLabel__ZJEuI\"><div><p dir=\"ltr\"><span>return</span></p></div></div></li><li class=\"QuizQuestionCard_quizCard__optionsList__optionItem__6OtkL false \"><div class=\"QuizQuestionCard_quizCard__optionsList__optionItem__optionInputSecond__Ye4j9 \n                                false\n                            \"></div><div class=\"QuizQuestionCard_quizCard__optionsList__optionItem__optionLabel__ZJEuI\"><div><p dir=\"ltr\"><span>switch</span></p></div></div></li><li class=\"QuizQuestionCard_quizCard__optionsList__optionItem__6OtkL false \"><div class=\"QuizQuestionCard_quizCard__optionsList__optionItem__optionInputSecond__Ye4j9 \n                                false\n                            \"></div><div class=\"QuizQuestionCard_quizCard__optionsList__optionItem__optionLabel__ZJEuI\"><div><p dir=\"ltr\"><span>continue</span></p></div></div></li></ul></div><div class=\"QuizQuestionCard_quizCard__9T_0J\"><div class=\"QuizQuestionCard_quizCard__header__8owjs\"><p class=\"QuizQuestionCard_quizCard__header__questionNumber__GffEN\">Question <!-- -->5</p></div><div class=\"QuizQuestionCard_quizCard__quizQuestionTextContainer__CzNWr QuizQuestionCard_quizCard_notGfgTabs__q5ycp\"><div class=\"QuizQuestionCard_quizCard__quizQuestionTextContainer__question__tv5de\"><p dir=\"ltr\"><span>What is the purpose of function prototypes in C?</span></p></div></div><ul class=\"QuizQuestionCard_quizCard__optionsList__4pILJ\"><li class=\"QuizQuestionCard_quizCard__optionsList__optionItem__6OtkL false \"><div class=\"QuizQuestionCard_quizCard__optionsList__optionItem__optionInputSecond__Ye4j9 \n                                false\n                            \"></div><div class=\"QuizQuestionCard_quizCard__optionsList__optionItem__optionLabel__ZJEuI\"><div><p dir=\"ltr\"><span>To define functions</span></p><p><br></p></div></div></li><li class=\"QuizQuestionCard_quizCard__optionsList__optionItem__6OtkL false \"><div class=\"QuizQuestionCard_quizCard__optionsList__optionItem__optionInputSecond__Ye4j9 \n                                false\n                            \"></div><div class=\"QuizQuestionCard_quizCard__optionsList__optionItem__optionLabel__ZJEuI\"><div><p dir=\"ltr\"><span>To declare functions before use</span></p><p><br></p></div></div></li><li class=\"QuizQuestionCard_quizCard__optionsList__optionItem__6OtkL false \"><div class=\"QuizQuestionCard_quizCard__optionsList__optionItem__optionInputSecond__Ye4j9 \n                                false\n                            \"></div><div class=\"QuizQuestionCard_quizCard__optionsList__optionItem__optionLabel__ZJEuI\"><div><p dir=\"ltr\"><span>To remove functions</span></p></div></div></li><li class=\"QuizQuestionCard_quizCard__optionsList__optionItem__6OtkL false \"><div class=\"QuizQuestionCard_quizCard__optionsList__optionItem__optionInputSecond__Ye4j9 \n                                false\n                            \"></div><div class=\"QuizQuestionCard_quizCard__optionsList__optionItem__optionLabel__ZJEuI\"><div><p dir=\"ltr\"><span>To call functions</span></p><p><br></p></div></div></li></ul></div><div class=\"QuizQuestionCard_quizCard__9T_0J\"><div class=\"QuizQuestionCard_quizCard__header__8owjs\"><p class=\"QuizQuestionCard_quizCard__header__questionNumber__GffEN\">Question <!-- -->6</p></div><div class=\"QuizQuestionCard_quizCard__quizQuestionTextContainer__CzNWr QuizQuestionCard_quizCard_notGfgTabs__q5ycp\"><div class=\"QuizQuestionCard_quizCard__quizQuestionTextContainer__question__tv5de\"><p dir=\"ltr\"><span>Which of the following statements about function arguments is FALSE?</span></p><p><br></p></div></div><ul class=\"QuizQuestionCard_quizCard__optionsList__4pILJ\"><li class=\"QuizQuestionCard_quizCard__optionsList__optionItem__6OtkL false \"><div class=\"QuizQuestionCard_quizCard__optionsList__optionItem__optionInputSecond__Ye4j9 \n                                false\n                            \"></div><div class=\"QuizQuestionCard_quizCard__optionsList__optionItem__optionLabel__ZJEuI\"><div><p dir=\"ltr\"><span>Arguments are passed by value by default in C</span></p><p><br></p></div></div></li><li class=\"QuizQuestionCard_quizCard__optionsList__optionItem__6OtkL false \"><div class=\"QuizQuestionCard_quizCard__optionsList__optionItem__optionInputSecond__Ye4j9 \n                                false\n                            \"></div><div class=\"QuizQuestionCard_quizCard__optionsList__optionItem__optionLabel__ZJEuI\"><div><p dir=\"ltr\"><span>You can pass arrays to functions</span></p><p><br></p></div></div></li><li class=\"QuizQuestionCard_quizCard__optionsList__optionItem__6OtkL false \"><div class=\"QuizQuestionCard_quizCard__optionsList__optionItem__optionInputSecond__Ye4j9 \n                                false\n                            \"></div><div class=\"QuizQuestionCard_quizCard__optionsList__optionItem__optionLabel__ZJEuI\"><div><p dir=\"ltr\"><span>C allows passing functions as arguments</span></p><p><br></p></div></div></li><li class=\"QuizQuestionCard_quizCard__optionsList__optionItem__6OtkL false \"><div class=\"QuizQuestionCard_quizCard__optionsList__optionItem__optionInputSecond__Ye4j9 \n                                false\n                            \"></div><div class=\"QuizQuestionCard_quizCard__optionsList__optionItem__optionLabel__ZJEuI\"><div><p dir=\"ltr\"><span>Arguments can be modified directly in the caller</span></p><p><br></p></div></div></li></ul></div><div class=\"QuizQuestionCard_quizCard__9T_0J\"><div class=\"QuizQuestionCard_quizCard__header__8owjs\"><p class=\"QuizQuestionCard_quizCard__header__questionNumber__GffEN\">Question <!-- -->7</p></div><div class=\"QuizQuestionCard_quizCard__quizQuestionTextContainer__CzNWr QuizQuestionCard_quizCard_notGfgTabs__q5ycp\"><div class=\"QuizQuestionCard_quizCard__quizQuestionTextContainer__question__tv5de\"><p dir=\"ltr\"><span>What happens if a function is called before it is defined and declared?</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><br></p></div></div><ul class=\"QuizQuestionCard_quizCard__optionsList__4pILJ\"><li class=\"QuizQuestionCard_quizCard__optionsList__optionItem__6OtkL false \"><div class=\"QuizQuestionCard_quizCard__optionsList__optionItem__optionInputSecond__Ye4j9 \n                                false\n                            \"></div><div class=\"QuizQuestionCard_quizCard__optionsList__optionItem__optionLabel__ZJEuI\"><div><p dir=\"ltr\"><span>The program will run normally</span><br></p></div></div></li><li class=\"QuizQuestionCard_quizCard__optionsList__optionItem__6OtkL false \"><div class=\"QuizQuestionCard_quizCard__optionsList__optionItem__optionInputSecond__Ye4j9 \n                                false\n                            \"></div><div class=\"QuizQuestionCard_quizCard__optionsList__optionItem__optionLabel__ZJEuI\"><div><p dir=\"ltr\"><span>A runtime error will occur</span></p></div></div></li><li class=\"QuizQuestionCard_quizCard__optionsList__optionItem__6OtkL false \"><div class=\"QuizQuestionCard_quizCard__optionsList__optionItem__optionInputSecond__Ye4j9 \n                                false\n                            \"></div><div class=\"QuizQuestionCard_quizCard__optionsList__optionItem__optionLabel__ZJEuI\"><div><p dir=\"ltr\"><span>A compiler error will occur</span></p></div></div></li><li class=\"QuizQuestionCard_quizCard__optionsList__optionItem__6OtkL false \"><div class=\"QuizQuestionCard_quizCard__optionsList__optionItem__optionInputSecond__Ye4j9 \n                                false\n                            \"></div><div class=\"QuizQuestionCard_quizCard__optionsList__optionItem__optionLabel__ZJEuI\"><div><p dir=\"ltr\"><span>The function will be skipped</span></p></div></div></li></ul></div><div class=\"QuizQ